Pipe shells: a turn of the spine's tangent between two of its edges is a
mitred corner from 1e-4 rad on, no longer from 1e-2 rad (mitcad#1559).

BRepOffsetAPI_MakePipeShell::SetTransitionMode set BRepFill_PipeShell's
transition with its default angles. Under Angmin, two edges' laws are
joined by turning the second's whole frame onto the first's end frame
(BRepFill_LocationLaw::TransformInCompatibleLaw), so through a kink of up
to 1e-2 rad (0.57 degrees) the section kept the first edge's frame and
leaned from square by the kink all along the second edge: 0.05 and 0.3
degrees along two B-spline pieces meeting at those angles. For mitred
corners (BRepBuilderAPI_RightCorner) a kink from 1e-4 rad (0.0057
degrees) on is now a corner, and the section is square to each edge.
Joints of pieces meant to be tangent, whose tangents differ by the noise
of their approximation (an intersection curve's pieces of chains joined
tangentially: some 2e-6 rad), stay under it.

Rounded corners keep 1e-2 rad: the turn of a section about a slight kink
is a sliver that does not close (a closed stirrup of lines and arcs whose
arcs meet two lines at 0.12 degrees came out invalid with rounded corners
there, where a pipe's mitre elsewhere had failed).

diff --git a/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKOffset/BRepOffsetAPI/BRepOffsetAPI_MakePipeShell.cxx b/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKOffset/BRepOffsetAPI/BRepOffsetAPI_MakePipeShell.cxx
--- a/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKOffset/BRepOffsetAPI/BRepOffsetAPI_MakePipeShell.cxx
+++ b/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKOffset/BRepOffsetAPI/BRepOffsetAPI_MakePipeShell.cxx
@@ -193,7 +193,19 @@
 
 void BRepOffsetAPI_MakePipeShell::SetTransitionMode(const BRepBuilderAPI_TransitionMode Mode)
 {
-  myPipe->SetTransition((BRepFill_TransitionStyle)Mode);
+  // A mitred corner from a turn of the spine's tangent of 1e-4 rad on:
+  // through a smaller turn than the angle given the section keeps its frame
+  // and leans by the turn. A rounded corner from 1e-2 rad on, as before:
+  // the turn of a section about a slight kink is a sliver that does not
+  // close.
+  if (Mode == BRepBuilderAPI_RightCorner)
+  {
+    myPipe->SetTransition((BRepFill_TransitionStyle)Mode, 1.0e-4);
+  }
+  else
+  {
+    myPipe->SetTransition((BRepFill_TransitionStyle)Mode);
+  }
 }
 
